{"title":"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the smallest natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> which has the following properties:\n</p><p>(a) Its decimal representation has 6 as the last digit.\n</p><p>(b) If the last digit 6 is erased and placed in front of the remaining digits, the resulting number is four times as large as the original number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9y5UUNIhUfU?si=PzXbNokxOXCRxYBh\">https://youtu.be/9y5UUNIhUfU?si=PzXbNokxOXCRxYBh</a>\n[Video Solution by little-fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As the new number starts with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the old number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/8/8f88d403085fe6600059002646348a5f267266d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> of the new number, the old number must start with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>As the new number now starts with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866b44935f69a5b800547127fe13210bb1e36fbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$61$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, the old number must start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afb80053f37ed91c90401431c492eda5b5f1268e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 61/4\\rfloor = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>We continue in this way until the process terminates with the new number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca9e5f0c27789a3c573b0d8a6e41cfc6390a3d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$615\\,384$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> and the old number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b1a9688278cf417103c9e3ddf8590cb861c019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{153\\,846}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know from the two properties that for some string <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b9f03bf602a0ff55b394a1e1b7596c3ea4521dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=10x+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />. Let the number of digits in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />; then moving the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the front would give it place value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f78b626e29df06e5c296ebb7218f07562833b276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" />; as a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/33988c9560170d45fb4cd0878616bcc493f5b4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n=6\\cdot10^a+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"16\" />. Multiplying this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d7432c4277faeec5a7ec814162764b868a3c6e99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40n=6\\cdot10^{a+1}+10x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />, and subtracting the former yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e01d190467591f8344b96697bcde2ece10e178.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39n=6(10^{a+1}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8b418cfdeb6023244792343a255c7c830e189d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13n=2(10^{a+1}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"21\" />. As a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbca20c138bd8dbe50430501b2c6cdfb83397abb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13|(10^{a+1}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fermat%27s_Little_Theorem\" title=\"Fermat&#39;s Little Theorem\">Fermat's Little Theorem</a>, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/106f30213fb5b807c43576fa5b240b2841523ecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{12}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so it isn't difficult to try values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64be5731bafe97ab8fb5d0f9c52c1c5362f963d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to find the smallest such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Eventually, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/92823db61b2b05f68dce62718454d18806be5b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^6-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ce7f41156f7daa970c9f93fd7816b35a8d2474c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{n=153846}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"103\" height=\"25\" />, and since the number ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is also an integer, so this is the solution.\n</p><p>~eevee9406\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the new resulting number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbbe9e951b0c4114efedceba4ce6e18183c586f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n = m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />, it follows (multiplying) that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abef9fdb0235b2ede2639538b5bd76711e058fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/0/2006489fca11179af50642349ff39ad4154cb2ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46\\cdot 4 = 184$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"14\" /> the last two digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />, hence the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b1d84dd533d395221aed4b41265312062192c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$846$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf40c458c93876817545844099ad24ea4118b148.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$846 \\cdot 4 = 3384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" /> the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c5505e205bbb801f064d35b4597cf46ee13842a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$384$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, hence the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/7/4474a5572b39f44911f36f2b0beef526c68d4a77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3846$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/a/28ac19eac86b6d66c3d3045d6b81cb0960f02e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3846\\cdot 4 = 15384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"14\" /> the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69ce984741da89dd25bc88d84bca81478ebae08f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, hence the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15ae94f1bd50652e5c54d5a2f0321645f1f30f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53846$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42abba4e39db6f15d8f5b3dfe4c11b1d7f665f08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53846\\cdot 4 = 215384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"148\" height=\"14\" /> the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2d5568e05f0f37ef18c52a7a171b7f6e5966d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />, hence the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a41271e9291f88d2accef1d71e423eb7cfa4e4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$153846$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />. Lastly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89f1f98f5e715e5b617585c7181d71aae004f904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$153846\\cdot 4 = 615384$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"14\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a41271e9291f88d2accef1d71e423eb7cfa4e4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$153846$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> is the smallest such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~not_detriti \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO\" title=\"1962 IMO\">1962 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 IMO P